From: Tutor Trellis <noreply@tutortrellis.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:20:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat(ios): system picture in picture for the call

JMSystemPictureInPicture drives AVKit's video call picture in picture
(AVPictureInPictureVideoCallViewController): when the app goes to the
background mid-call iOS shows a floating window with the participant on stage,
which can be moved, resized and tapped to return; it closes when the app is
active again, and when the conference ends. The window grows from and returns
to the JitsiMeetView the call is drawn in (JitsiMeetView tells it when it moves
into a window). It renders with react-native-webrtc's SampleBufferVideoCallView
and takes the video's shape; while there's no video (muted, or not coming
through) it shows the participant's initials and name instead of closing.

The SystemPictureInPicture native module (setEnabled, setSource, an event when
the window opens and closes) is driven by react/features/mobile/system-pip.
